{
  "description": "EIP-712 administrative-authorization vectors, generated from the contracts with script/GenerateAdminAuthorizationVectors.s.sol. Each vector carries the contract-computed digest of the capability's pinned struct bound to the wallet's own domain, and the vector owner's ECDSA signature over it, so an offchain implementation of the digest can be cross-checked against the contract's.",
  "domain": {"name": "CLLSmartAccount", "version": "1"},
  "note": "The signing keys are test-only. The vectors cover digest agreement, not execution: they are never submitted to a wallet. Each negative vector carries a signature over signed_digest (what the owner signed for differs from the presented fields as given in signed_with) that a correct verifier must reject for the presented wallet, capability and arguments, whose digest is expected_digest.",
